[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l019","ordinal":175361,"en":"His courage was precious, his venom strong;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l020","ordinal":175362,"en":"Lion Khoja was a mighty one."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l021","ordinal":175363,"en":"Beneath him he had thoroughbred stock;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l022","ordinal":175364,"en":"Across the whole world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l023","ordinal":175365,"en":"Dear lion Khoja"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l024","ordinal":175366,"en":"Had strength to strike it down like grain."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l025","ordinal":175367,"en":"Had he not traveled with Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l026","ordinal":175368,"en":"And grown beside him?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l027","ordinal":175369,"en":"Had he not seen"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l028","ordinal":175370,"en":"Calamitous great tumults?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l029","ordinal":175371,"en":"Was he not wise among spearmen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l030","ordinal":175372,"en":"A resourceful khoja?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l031","ordinal":175373,"en":"Did he not know the enemy's stratagems well,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l032","ordinal":175374,"en":"A mighty khoja?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l033","ordinal":175375,"en":"In his youth, among good men,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l034","ordinal":175376,"en":"Had Khoja not grown?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l035","ordinal":175377,"en":"From lion, gray wolf Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l036","ordinal":175378,"en":"Receiving so much instruction,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l037","ordinal":175379,"en":"Had Khoja not become seasoned?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l038","ordinal":175380,"en":"Armor no bullet could pierce—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1286:b004:l039","ordinal":175381,"en":"Had Khoja not worn it beneath his clothes?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l001","ordinal":175382,"en":"Having fought in many battles,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l002","ordinal":175383,"en":"Was Kojo not one who knew"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l003","ordinal":175384,"en":"How to unleash upheaval?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l004","ordinal":175385,"en":"Yesterday, when your bloodthirsty lion Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l005","ordinal":175386,"en":"Brought turmoil upon Beijing of Chin-Machin"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l006","ordinal":175387,"en":"And the people of the true Kakan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l007","ordinal":175388,"en":"When he seized the khanate"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l008","ordinal":175389,"en":"Of the swarming Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l009","ordinal":175390,"en":"When he imposed tribute upon China"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l010","ordinal":175391,"en":"And raided its city,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l011","ordinal":175392,"en":"Was Kojo not the one who besieged"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l012","ordinal":175393,"en":"Its cities looming in might?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l013","ordinal":175394,"en":"Was Kojo not the one"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l014","ordinal":175395,"en":"Who made their khans stand rigid"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l015","ordinal":175396,"en":"And beat them down?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l016","ordinal":175397,"en":"Was Kojo not the one"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l017","ordinal":175398,"en":"Who unleashed relentless turmoil?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l018","ordinal":175399,"en":"At the gate of walled Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l019","ordinal":175400,"en":"From the hero called Kangur,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l020","ordinal":175401,"en":"From sixty sorcerer-warriors"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l021","ordinal":175402,"en":"Learned in wondrous arts,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l022","ordinal":175403,"en":"Was Kojo not the one who saddled"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l023","ordinal":175404,"en":"The accomplished swift Kara At?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l024","ordinal":175405,"en":"Was Kojo not the one who remained seven months"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l025","ordinal":175406,"en":"And studied sorcery?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l026","ordinal":175407,"en":"Was Kojo not the one who wore"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l027","ordinal":175408,"en":"A coat woven with spells?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l028","ordinal":175409,"en":"Was Kojo not the one who knew"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l029","ordinal":175410,"en":"The Chinese people's mighty war-prayers?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l030","ordinal":175411,"en":"At the name of your uncle Kojo today,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l031","ordinal":175412,"en":"People started in fear;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l032","ordinal":175413,"en":"He had read forty-two forms"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l033","ordinal":175414,"en":"Of the Chinese script."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l034","ordinal":175415,"en":"Was Kojo not the one who went"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l035","ordinal":175416,"en":"To Kakanchin's war?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l036","ordinal":175417,"en":"Was Kojo not there"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l037","ordinal":175418,"en":"In the seething, terrible slaughter?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l038","ordinal":175419,"en":"Was Kojo not the one who learned"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b003:l039","ordinal":175420,"en":"The ways of war?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l001","ordinal":175421,"en":"When the great Chinese and Manchu people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l002","ordinal":175422,"en":"Swift on foot before their khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l003","ordinal":175423,"en":"Engulfed them and reached them together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l004","ordinal":175424,"en":"When the heroes' shots went astray,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l005","ordinal":175425,"en":"When, at Beijing's fortress,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l006","ordinal":175426,"en":"Chubak, son of Akbaltai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l007","ordinal":175427,"en":"Was struck by a stray bullet"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l008","ordinal":175428,"en":"And vanished from sight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l009","ordinal":175429,"en":"When young Kojo grew wrathful"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l010","ordinal":175430,"en":"And spilled Muslim blood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l011","ordinal":175431,"en":"When all sense left"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l012","ordinal":175432,"en":"The Muslims' heads"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l013","ordinal":175433,"en":"And black fog covered them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l014","ordinal":175434,"en":"When the greatest of the sixty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l015","ordinal":175435,"en":"The finest of the Forty Companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l016","ordinal":175436,"en":"Syrgak, lay dying,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l017","ordinal":175437,"en":"When young Kojo grew wrathful,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l018","ordinal":175438,"en":"When Akkula fell to a bullet,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l019","ordinal":175439,"en":"When Almambet was martyred,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l020","ordinal":175440,"en":"Was Kojo not the one who went"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l021","ordinal":175441,"en":"To his uncle Almambet's side?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l022","ordinal":175442,"en":"Was Kojo not the one who took"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l023","ordinal":175443,"en":"The weather-stone that conjures weather,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l024","ordinal":175444,"en":"Thinking it might one day prove useful?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l025","ordinal":175445,"en":"Was Kojo not a champion"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l026","ordinal":175446,"en":"Of fighting by stratagem?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l027","ordinal":175447,"en":"Chynkojo, son of Shygai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l028","ordinal":175448,"en":"Was taut as red-hot iron;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l029","ordinal":175449,"en":"When you looked upon his frame,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l030","ordinal":175450,"en":"He resembled a spur of Kara-Too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l031","ordinal":175451,"en":"Do not ask what Kojo was like:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l032","ordinal":175452,"en":"Thick-armed and stone-hearted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l033","ordinal":175453,"en":"A giant as large as a mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l034","ordinal":175454,"en":"With a sable cap upon his head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l035","ordinal":175455,"en":"In this false world"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l036","ordinal":175456,"en":"A singular black-gray wolf."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l037","ordinal":175457,"en":"He had the flying Kara At;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l038","ordinal":175458,"en":"All who challenged him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1287:b004:l039","ordinal":175459,"en":"When wrath seized Chynkojo,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l001","ordinal":175460,"en":"Had the strength to crush them like flour."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l002","ordinal":175461,"en":"His courage was fierce and his venom strong;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l003","ordinal":175462,"en":"Abandon hope before Chynkojo,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l004","ordinal":175463,"en":"Whom the spirits had forgotten!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l005","ordinal":175464,"en":"Let us leave that thus"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l006","ordinal":175465,"en":"And begin with Chynkojo:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l007","ordinal":175466,"en":"Dear Kojo, renowned lord,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l008","ordinal":175467,"en":"Had, when he wished, such great worth;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l009","ordinal":175468,"en":"By custom he drank the blood"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l010","ordinal":175469,"en":"Of whoever came to challenge him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l011","ordinal":175470,"en":"Saying, \"I shall slaughter Manas's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l012","ordinal":175471,"en":"And bring slaughter"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l013","ordinal":175472,"en":"Upon the accursed fugitive,\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l014","ordinal":175473,"en":"He grew black with rage;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l015","ordinal":175474,"en":"Thus remained that renowned lord."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l016","ordinal":175475,"en":"His saddlecloth was leather;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l017","ordinal":175476,"en":"No mortal could withstand"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l018","ordinal":175477,"en":"This Kojo's courage."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l019","ordinal":175478,"en":"Look at the flood coursing from the slope;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l020","ordinal":175479,"en":"Look at hero Kojo, like a flood."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l021","ordinal":175480,"en":"Look at the water flowing with a roar;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l022","ordinal":175481,"en":"Look at the uproar Chynkojo caused."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l023","ordinal":175482,"en":"Look at the dark-sworded conflagration;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l024","ordinal":175483,"en":"Look at the fire Chynkojo kindled."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l025","ordinal":175484,"en":"Look at the black trench that was dug;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l026","ordinal":175485,"en":"Look at the suffering"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l027","ordinal":175486,"en":"Dear Kojo the leopard brought engulfing them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l028","ordinal":175487,"en":"Was Kojo not one born"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l029","ordinal":175488,"en":"And come into this world?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l030","ordinal":175489,"en":"Was Kojo not one who punished"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l031","ordinal":175490,"en":"Whoever challenged him?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l032","ordinal":175491,"en":"At a spur of the lower mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l033","ordinal":175492,"en":"At a jutting, narrowing promontory,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l034","ordinal":175493,"en":"What did dear Kojo do?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l035","ordinal":175494,"en":"He unleashed an upheaval"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l036","ordinal":175495,"en":"And drove the fleeing mass of Zhediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l037","ordinal":175496,"en":"Before him under the whip:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l038","ordinal":175497,"en":"\"Damn your fathers, Zhediger;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b003:l039","ordinal":175498,"en":"If you flee, you have eaten filth!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l001","ordinal":175499,"en":"Is Zheti-Özön such a feeble land?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l002","ordinal":175500,"en":"Is Semetey a greater hero than I?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l003","ordinal":175501,"en":"Not one of you bore a banner;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l004","ordinal":175502,"en":"You have fled straight away,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l005","ordinal":175503,"en":"Not remembering that your falcon Kojo lives;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l006","ordinal":175504,"en":"Unable to stand, you have run."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l007","ordinal":175505,"en":"Zhediger of Zheti-Suu,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l008","ordinal":175506,"en":"While this accomplished head remains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l009","ordinal":175507,"en":"I shall catch and gather you."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l010","ordinal":175508,"en":"I shall slaughter you all,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l011","ordinal":175509,"en":"And then find Semetey."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l012","ordinal":175510,"en":"Do you not see, Zhediger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l013","ordinal":175511,"en":"The heroism I have shown?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l014","ordinal":175512,"en":"Will you not share, Zhediger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l015","ordinal":175513,"en":"The gain I have won?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l016","ordinal":175514,"en":"My heroism is of another order;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l017","ordinal":175515,"en":"My wrestling strength beyond measure!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l018","ordinal":175516,"en":"There is no division at Kara-Suu;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l019","ordinal":175517,"en":"Babbling Zhediger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l020","ordinal":175518,"en":"While this dear head remains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l021","ordinal":175519,"en":"There is no death for you at all!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l022","ordinal":175520,"en":"Do not flee, Zhediger;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l023","ordinal":175521,"en":"There is no one who can resist!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l024","ordinal":175522,"en":"Damn your fathers, Zhediger;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l025","ordinal":175523,"en":"You have white-bearded elders"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l026","ordinal":175524,"en":"And all your resourceful old men."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l027","ordinal":175525,"en":"In alarm before Manas's wretched son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l028","ordinal":175526,"en":"You have taken fright;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l029","ordinal":175527,"en":"Great Black Zhediger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l030","ordinal":175528,"en":"All of you in panic"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l031","ordinal":175529,"en":"Have fled away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l032","ordinal":175530,"en":"If you flee, Zhediger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l033","ordinal":175531,"en":"I shall unleash an upheaval;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l034","ordinal":175532,"en":"If my black fury seizes me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l035","ordinal":175533,"en":"I shall seize every one of you"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l036","ordinal":175534,"en":"And turn you into black earth!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l037","ordinal":175535,"en":"Would men who have seen an enemy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l038","ordinal":175536,"en":"Panic and lose their wits?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1288:b004:l039","ordinal":175537,"en":"Accursed Zhediger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l001","ordinal":175538,"en":"Would a people with a prince flee?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l002","ordinal":175539,"en":"You old men in white turbans,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l003","ordinal":175540,"en":"All of you have fled;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l004","ordinal":175541,"en":"You resourceful old men,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l005","ordinal":175542,"en":"All of you have fled!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l006","ordinal":175543,"en":"It was the time when Chynkojo"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l007","ordinal":175544,"en":"Surrounded the great Black Zhediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l008","ordinal":175545,"en":"And drove them before him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l009","ordinal":175546,"en":"Whoever resisted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l010","ordinal":175547,"en":"He threw belly-down across a horse"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l011","ordinal":175548,"en":"And bound fast."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l012","ordinal":175549,"en":"He inflicted every kind of wrath;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l013","ordinal":175550,"en":"Chynkojo drove away the Zhediger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l014","ordinal":175551,"en":"Leaving not one behind."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l015","ordinal":175552,"en":"Those fated to die perished;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l016","ordinal":175553,"en":"Those who survived Kojo, son of Shygai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l017","ordinal":175554,"en":"After the deaths,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l018","ordinal":175555,"en":"Suffered utter humiliation."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l019","ordinal":175556,"en":"Roaring in his fury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l020","ordinal":175557,"en":"What did dear Kojo do?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l021","ordinal":175558,"en":"He began an upheaval."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l022","ordinal":175559,"en":"Unable to withstand his wrath,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l023","ordinal":175560,"en":"The great Black Zhediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l024","ordinal":175561,"en":"Were slaughtered and cast down."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l025","ordinal":175562,"en":"He heaped humiliation upon them like sheep;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l026","ordinal":175563,"en":"What did dear Kojo do?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l027","ordinal":175564,"en":"He drove away"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l028","ordinal":175565,"en":"Every one of the Zhediger."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l029","ordinal":175566,"en":"Unable to find any recourse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l030","ordinal":175567,"en":"Many of the Zhediger's great host"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l031","ordinal":175568,"en":"Rushed about in panic."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l032","ordinal":175569,"en":"Many more fled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l033","ordinal":175570,"en":"Trying to protect their lives."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l034","ordinal":175571,"en":"To flee away together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l035","ordinal":175572,"en":"One called to another, \"Come!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l036","ordinal":175573,"en":"Many went urging one another."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l037","ordinal":175574,"en":"Many cursed their fathers and grandfathers"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l038","ordinal":175575,"en":"Without letting Kojo hear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b003:l039","ordinal":175576,"en":"Many grieved"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l001","ordinal":175577,"en":"Without speaking a word."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l002","ordinal":175578,"en":"Many despaired then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l003","ordinal":175579,"en":"Of their lives held in trust."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l004","ordinal":175580,"en":"Many said, \"We have suffered humiliation"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l005","ordinal":175581,"en":"At the hands of dog Kojo\";"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l006","ordinal":175582,"en":"Many said, \"Semetey slaughtered us;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l007","ordinal":175583,"en":"We are dead.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l008","ordinal":175584,"en":"Many horses then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l009","ordinal":175585,"en":"Bucked and plunged without stopping."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l010","ordinal":175586,"en":"Many went weeping, saying,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l011","ordinal":175587,"en":"\"Alas, we shall die without seeing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l012","ordinal":175588,"en":"Our wives and children.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l013","ordinal":175589,"en":"He unleashed an upheaval;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l014","ordinal":175590,"en":"Dear Kojo drove them"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l015","ordinal":175591,"en":"Before him under the whip."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l016","ordinal":175592,"en":"Then a khan like Chynkojo"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l017","ordinal":175593,"en":"Arose among the Zhediger;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l018","ordinal":175594,"en":"When they saw Chynkojo,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l019","ordinal":175595,"en":"Life left the Zhediger."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l020","ordinal":175596,"en":"Among the Zhediger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l021","ordinal":175597,"en":"Chynkojo, son of Shygai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l022","ordinal":175598,"en":"Among the Zhediger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l023","ordinal":175599,"en":"Was the most skillful of spearmen;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l024","ordinal":175600,"en":"He subdued the whole world—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l025","ordinal":175601,"en":"That mighty Chynkojo."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l026","ordinal":175602,"en":"White sacred banner and red flag—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l027","ordinal":175603,"en":"The helpless Zhediger marched on"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l028","ordinal":175604,"en":"Amid shouting and uproar;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l029","ordinal":175605,"en":"Blue sacred banner and red flag—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l030","ordinal":175606,"en":"They now saw things never seen before"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l031","ordinal":175607,"en":"Amid the uproar."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l032","ordinal":175608,"en":"Many could not then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l033","ordinal":175609,"en":"Find any recourse."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l034","ordinal":175610,"en":"\"That fool who fled his village"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l035","ordinal":175611,"en":"Has truly done this to us,\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l036","ordinal":175612,"en":"Many said, reviling him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l037","ordinal":175613,"en":"They had now reached and clung"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l038","ordinal":175614,"en":"To a narrow pass like a saddle-back;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1289:b005:l039","ordinal":175615,"en":"When they reached that narrow pass,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1290:b003:l001","ordinal":175616,"en":"The people had lost all recourse."}]
